            "notes": "It's important to get the item [Firestarter](item_8b678022-0eeb-4535-8413-8ad1dbda82d3) ASAP. \n\nYou can't rely on your healers to always get to you, especially if you're on the back line, out of sight. \n\nYou'll feel naked but you need this pronto and it has a good amount of health for sustaining in fights. Purchase [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) , [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) , and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) if you have cash left over. \n\nAlways prioritize Ability Power and Life Steal for this build. So purchase in that order.",
