            "notes": "I always pick [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) for Round 3 but you can pick [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) if you like having Coach Gun as an escape. \n\nIf you are getting bullied by [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) and [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) then it's crucial that you pick [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) earlier as this does a good amount of burn damage to the enemy and retains it's knockback effect.\n\nYou CAN pick [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) first if you're not having an issue with [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) or up-close enemies like [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) , [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) , [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) , [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) , or [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)\n\n[Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) synergizes well with [Firestarter](item_8b678022-0eeb-4535-8413-8ad1dbda82d3) but prioritize  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) if you don't have enough money for both.\n\nYou can also sell your greens if needed since these are just stat fillers.",
