            "notes": "For round 5 you'll need to pick one of the two skills from Round 3. Either [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) or  [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) . \n\nMoney will be tight this round but try to pickup [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) to increase Burn Damage. Sell [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) if needed.\n\nIf you're really strapped for money, buy some green items to make up the Ability Power but try to get [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262)",
