            "created_at": "2025-07-06T17:46:19.00631+00:00",
            "notes": "For Round 6 you have two options depending on your situation. If you're doing great and you just want to beef up your Ability Power, pick [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) for an additional 35% Ability Power.\n\nIf you're getting bullied by the enemy tank, [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) , [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) or [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) then you should pick  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) + [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) .\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) decreases the enemies ability to heal by 30% which is quite a bit. \n\nHitting an unshielded tank with this + your Dynamite rotation can be devastating. Any enemy lingering around the tank will also get punished heavily. [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) will help you with some Ability Power and set you up for your last Power for Round 7.",
