            "notes": "I usually pick [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) in Round 7. If you've made it to Round 7, it means the enemy team is pretty equal with yours and you need something extra to push the win. Pairing [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) with Silver Lighter means you'll be throwing out BOB almost every 2 minutes due to the amount of Ability power items you have. This can be a huge disrupter and force the enemy healers to waste their ultimate's early.\n\nIf you haven't picked up [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) yet, make sure you grab it now.\n\nYou can use your remaining points on the Optional Items - or whatever you can afford.\n\nYou may not need [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) . In this case it's okay to Purchase [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you've been struggling with enemies in your face the whole game. \n\nRound 7 is an important time to pick an item that will push the fight in your favor. Don't pick some generic item that just adds extra stats. This will not help you.\n\nIf you cannot afford [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) , sell [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and snag an Optional Item.",
